Comparing with exponent \frac{28000}{T} gives \frac{E_{a}}{R} = 28000 \text{ K}
Thus E_{a} = 28000 \times 8.3 = 232400 \text{ J mol}^{-1} = 232 \text{ kJ mol}^{-1}
